╭─ rival · config ────────────────────────────────────── ~/.rival/config.yaml ─╮|
│ 1 Proxy  2 Models  3 Review  4 Check                                         │|
│                                                                              │|
│    Claude via proxy    ○ off   Opus, Fable use their own login               │|
│    Codex via proxy     ○ off   Codex, Sol use their own login                │|
│    URL                 not set                                   ○ proxy off │|
│  ▸ Key                 ••••••••                                              │|
│                        enter types or pastes a new key; s saves it (0600)    │|
│    Claude prefix       ‹ none ›   route off                                  │|
│    Codex prefix        ‹ none ›   route off                                  │|
│                                                                              │|
│  REQUESTS GO TO                                                              │|
│    codex  Codex      direct  → gpt-6-astra                                   │|
│    sol    Sol 6.1    direct  → gpt-6.1-sol                                   │|
│    claude Opus 5.5   direct  → claude-opus-5-5                               │|
│    fable  Fable 5.1  direct  → claude-fable-5-1                              │|
│                                                                              │|
│                                                                              │|
│                                                                              │|
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤|
│  CHECK  not run · c checks the draft                             ○ proxy off │|
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤|
│ enter save field  esc cancel  paste works; the key is never shown            │|
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯|
